        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Plain gauze weave in pale blue silk with two heavier yarns added at intervals in the warp and weft to form window-pane pattern. Small floral sprays brocaded at intersections of these heavy yarns. Selvedge on both sides of wide blue stripe. Edge turned under and hemmed at one end."@en ;
